# Parlo swiftformat configuration.
#
# SwiftFormat owns layout: whitespace, wrapping, commas, import order.
# SwiftLint owns meaning: naming, complexity, size, correctness.
# Rules where the two overlap are disabled on the SwiftLint side — see
# .swiftlint.yml — so that `just lint` and `just format-check` cannot
# contradict each other.
--swiftversion 6.2
--indent 4
--maxwidth 130
--exclude .build,**/.build,DerivedData,Parlo.xcodeproj
--importgrouping alpha
--stripunusedargs closure-only
--self remove
--wraparguments before-first
--wrapcollections before-first

# Both of these are SwiftFormat defaults today, pinned so a future change of
# default cannot silently churn the tree or re-open the fight with SwiftLint.
--trailing-commas always
# Parlo writes its tests as raw identifiers (74 of them). Keep that: switching
# would rewrite every test name in the repo.
--test-case-name-format raw-identifiers
